    "main_topic": [
      {
        "h_title": "How A Thai Chef Makes Northern-Style Laab & Sticky Rice",
        "main_title": "How A Thai Chef Makes Northern-Style Laab & Sticky Rice",
        "author": "@epicurious",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "No one say larb in Thailand, we say laab.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Laab is a celebratory dish.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "You see it at a temple fair, housewarming, or wedding,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I am from Chiang Mai, Thailand and this is laab.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The laab that you see in America is from Isan,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "mostly make with toasted rice powder.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Today we're gonna make laab kua,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "which is from Northern Thailand,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "which make with aromatic gorgeous spices and chili.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "To laab is to mince the meat, kua is to dry salt it.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "We are going to prepare laab chili seasoning,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "which in Thai we call prik laab.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "So we have Sichuan peppercorn,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "which is a substitute for Makhwaen that we use in Thailand,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "white peppercorn, star anise, cinnamon, dried chili, nutmeg,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "dee plee, coriander seed, clove, mace, luk krawan, and salt.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "You wanna make sure that you are not gonna burn your spice.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I'm toasting all this to bring the best of the quality",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "of all the spices out.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "You know it's ready when you see it",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "a little bit toasted and drier,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "and your nose will tell that.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The smell right now is like you go into a spice market.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I think this is all ready to go.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "This is one of my cannot live without utensil",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "in my Thai kitchen.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "It's my krok or stone mortar and pestle.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Thai style is different than the Mexican one",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "because it's deeper and we need that area",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "to make curry paste, to make nam phrik,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "and you know, with this chili laab.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "If you don't have a krok home",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "just use your favorite food processor.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "So I'm gonna put in all the spices that I toast.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I am pounding until it's well blend, well mixed.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "All right, I'm gonna blend some salt in there",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "just to make sure like it well season.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "After a couple minutes, look at the texture",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "of my laab chili seasoning.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I think like the most authentic",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "and the most delicious to eat with laab",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "is with the khao niao or the long grain glutinous rice.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "When you hear the term sticky rice",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "you would think of your favorite dessert, right?",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Coconut sticky rice and mango.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "It is pretty much the same thing without any sweetener.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I am going to soak my glutinous rice",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "in a room temperature water, and I'm gonna let it soak there",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "for six hours or up to an overnight.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "It makes this sticky rice, you know,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "soft and gentle and it just more pleasant.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The rice has been soaked and drain.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Look at this steamer set, in Thai we call it huad.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The other component, before I make it to the steamer",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "All I do, just line it on the top of it",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "just to keep it moist and it's easier to just,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "you know, like flip it.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "So I'm gonna put everything in, kind of make it even.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Now we're gonna put the lid on",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "and let it cook for about 10 minutes,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "and we are gonna come back and check.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "It looks quite good already.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The bottom part's already cooked,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "so I'm gonna flip it and cooked the top part of it",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "So flip it back.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The beauty of making sticky rice",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "is you don't have to be so precise.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "No ratios or no measurement.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The rice would change from opaque to translucent.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I'm gonna flip it up again.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "My sticky rice is perfectly cooked.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "See? Look at this.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "How starchy it is, how sticky it is by itself.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "It's time to laab the pork.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "To laab something is mean to mince something.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I'm choosing the cleaver because of its heaviness",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "that it would help me to laab my meat faster.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I'm doing the pork tenderloin and pork liver.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I'm gonna start with the liver.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I love the the richness.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "If you don't like liver, just don't put it in.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I'm just going to slice this thinly,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "and then I'm gonna do my pork tenderloin.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I'm just gonna slice it thinly.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "And this is the most important part.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I've seen the community gather together to make laab.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The double action just impress me so much.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Whew, I think we're good.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Now I'm gonna give my laab mixture a massage.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "You can tell that the spice blend",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "and the pork and liver mixture is like well incorporated.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "These are fresh herbs that I'm going to be putting",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "in my laab, starting with lemongrass.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I hit it because it release the aromatic oil.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Lemongrass is a darling in Thai cuisine.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "You see it in every regions of Thailand.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Shallot and I'm just going to like thinly slice them",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "And look, I'm using the special part, the root part of it.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The leaf taste like the lime brine.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "It's what used in a lot of Thai curry paste.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Now my fresh herbs are prep.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Let's make some laab.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Laab is pretty much straightforward.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "It's just a saute of everything together.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Start with vegetable oil.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I'm throwing in the chili right now",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "simply because I don't want it to get cooked",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "in a super hot oil.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Now the garlic is like golden, save that to garnish later.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "And then in the shallots, in the lemongrass.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "If you meet your friends at the street instead of asking,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "How are you?",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "In Thailand we ask, Where are you going?",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "and, Have you eaten?",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "'Cause food is very important and we just wanna make sure",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "that everybody's well fed.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Now that my lemongrass, shallot,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "and garlic started to get golden,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I am putting in the pork and the liver mixture.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "If the texture gets dry a little bit,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "it's okay to put in some water to help it to cook.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "It looks about 90% cooked.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I'm gonna throw in the fresh herbs that I cut earlier.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I'm adding fish sauce again to your taste.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "It's fishy, but it has a hint of sweetness into it.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "It makes a dish.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Our laab is ready, now it is time to plate.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "This is a special platter.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "In Northern Thailand, we call it khan toke.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "What I'm gonna do is I'm going",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "to build my crudite platters.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Along with sticky rice, we eat laab with a lot of vegetable.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Having fresh vegetable also play a vital role",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "when having laab because it can help cool down the heat.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "You can use any kind of vegetable.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I am transporting my laab to the top.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The chop of cilantro.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Next is the crispy garlic.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "And the khaep mu or the crispy pork rind.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "And that is a laab kua that would make my dad proud.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "I keep the sticky rice in the bamboo basket,",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "and I roll it between my fingers and my palm.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Or you can use a spoon and transfer it onto your plate.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Use my thumb and my fingers.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Just grab all the bits of the meat.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "And then you pick your favorite herbs as a crudite.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Vegetables of your choice.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "It's so aromatics, it's earthy.",
